{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54851","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛟蛇见，营寨必（京本作「不」）宜攻。\n更有青蛇人病疾，黄蛇疫瘴总成凶，移寨（京本作「徙」）免灾凶（京本作「逢」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}